{{Set(name="requested_slot", value=GetPersonaAttribute(id=userId, field="last_availability_requested_datetime"))}}
{{Set(name="schema", value=_schemasSkill(checkAvailabilitySchema="True"))}}
{{#system~}}
You must determine if the **date** and **time** components of the `requested_slot` (which you will extract into the `requested_datetime` field) has a match in the `availability` for any `location/doctor/provider/room` etc.
Note: For entities that are booked by date only (like **rooms**), match only the **date** component and ignore the time.

If the `requested_datetime` is **not** an exact match (i.e., `slot_available` is false), you must identify up to two overall **closest** available slots to `requested_datetime`. These slots are determined by finding the smallest absolute time differences between `requested_datetime` and all entries in `available_slots` (considering each slot at each specific `location/doctor/provider/room` etc.). The two selected slots could be one earlier and one later, both earlier, or both later than `requested_datetime`. Populate the `nearest_available_slots` field with these two slots (or one, if only one available slot exists in total across all locations/doctors/providers/rooms etc.), listed in chronological order. Ensure these slots are actual times from `available_slots`.

Adhere strictly to the JSON-Schema for the output structure and all field definitions.

# Task Context
requested_slot: {{requested_slot}}

availability: {{availability}}
{{~/system}}

{{#assistant~}}{{Set(name="availability_json", value=Gen(jsonSchema=schema, validateSchema=True, temperature=0.1, topP=0, thinkingBudget=425))}}{{~/assistant}}

{{#if GetValueJSON(obj=availability_json, key="slot_available") == "true"}}
    {{#if GetValueJSON(obj=availability_json, key="several_entities") == "true"}}
        {{Return(val=Concat("the user requested slot ", requested_slot, " is available in the ", Stringify(GetValueJSON(obj=availability_json, key="entities")), ". Ask which option they prefer."))}}
    {{else}}
        {{Return(val=Concat("the user requested slot ", requested_slot, " is available in the ", Stringify(GetValueJSON(obj=availability_json, key="entities")), ". Do not tell reservation is confirmed. Just inform the user about the availability and ask if the option works for them."))}}
    {{/if}}
{{else}}
    {{Return(val=Concat("the user requested slot ", requested_slot, " is not available. The nearest available slots are: ", Stringify(GetValueJSON(obj=availability_json, key="nearest_available_slots")), ". Tell the user about that. Do not tell the reservation is confirmed. Just inform the user about the availability and ask which option works best for them."))}}
{{/if}}
